          "Engage wage and wage floor concerns directly: the median income of $46,492 and young, working-class demographic composition mean that minimum wage, benefits access, and job quality are the lived economic reality for much of the constituency; a legislative record demonstrating specific advocacy on these issues is essential to maintaining credibility.",
