          "Recognize that 72% is a strong coalition that requires active maintenance, not a safe supermajority that permits neglect: young renters and working-class Black voters support you conditionally on whether you are delivering on their economic concerns; a candidate who campaigns defensively or assumes the base is locked in risks that primary or general opposition emerges from within the existing coalition."
