          "Invest in sustained engagement with the college-educated plurality (42.5%): this constituency evaluates on education policy specifics, healthcare access, and institutional credibility; communicate Johnson's record on school funding, post-secondary affordability, and responsive constituent service to prevent Democratic persuasion of this swing-prone demographic.",
          "Build active relationship with the 5.65% Asian community through targeted outreach on business opportunity, immigration policy clarity, and educational access; this community is large enough to influence a competitive election and does not default to Republican alignment — specific engagement prevents future Democratic gains in this constituency.",
          "Monitor the 43% opposition intensity and composition: survey whether opposition is concentrated among younger renters (29.6%), among college-educated voters frustrated by specific policy positions, or among the Asian community; identify and address the primary source of competitive vulnerability before a credible challenger emerges."
