          { name: "Ideological Positioning Over Fiscal Results", tag: "avoid", why: "FL-HD-25 is not a district that votes primarily on conservative ideology or cultural positioning; it votes on whether government is delivering concrete results on property tax fairness, cost management, and quality-of-life services. Any candidate who leads with abstract ideological messaging rather than demonstrating specific fiscal accomplishments and community service will underperform relative to their party identification in a district this affluent and college-educated." }
