          "Engage the Hispanic-majority constituency (45.6%) with specificity on economic mobility, quality public education, and professional pathway investment — not with generic Latino outreach; this is a working-class, education-investing community that evaluates candidates on whether they are delivering concrete improvements in schools, job training, and small business opportunity.",
