          "Address property tax sustainability and cost-of-living stability directly: for a $80,157 median income, 47.2-year-old, 79.6% homeowner constituency, tax fairness and the ability to sustain housing costs are the foundational economic security issues that determine whether government is delivering.",
          "Do not assume 68% is a durable floor: affluent suburban constituencies have proven volatile when they perceive governance failures or when candidates emphasize partisan conflict over specific policy solutions; consolidate the existing coalition while remaining attentive to the 32% opposition and swing voters within the educated homeowner base.",
          "Ensure minority communities' concerns are not peripheral: approximately 17% of the district is Hispanic and Black, and in an affluent, heavily white district, these communities' economic mobility, healthcare access, and civic participation concerns risk invisibility; specific constituent attention prevents them from organizing alternative political representation."
